39 + 4 = 43 \text{ students}
$$

We are also told that only 26 students were called back. To find the number of students who didn't make the cut, we subtract the number of students who were called back from the total number of students:

$$
43 - 26 = 17
$$

Thus, the number of students who didn't make the cut is:

$$
\boxed{17}
$$

