$$
79 - 44 = 35
$$

So, 35 pictures are left to be distributed into 5 different albums.

To determine how many pictures are in each of these 5 albums, we divide the remaining 35 pictures by 5:

$$
35 \div 5 = 7
$$

Therefore, each of the 5 different albums contains 7 pictures.

$$
\boxed{7}
$$

