Now, these 15 pictures are divided into 5 different albums. The question is asking how many pictures are in each of those 5 albums. Assuming that the pictures are divided equally among the 5 albums, I would divide 15 by 5. Let me check that: 15 divided by 5 is 3. So each album would have 3 pictures.

